      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To fulfill the task, I need to create a Python script that upserts a JSON document using a concrete external provider. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use AWS DynamoDB as the external provider, as it supports upsert operations and is a widely used service. The script will include the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with DynamoDB. </thinking>\n",
